The [[Torch]] is an item obtainable by combining the [[Lump of Coal]] and the [[Wooden Sword]], which are each common items available in the shop for all characters. At the start of a battle, it deals higher DPS than the [[Wooden Sword]] (although comparable to a [[Wooden Sword]] socketed with a [[Lump of Coal]]). With each hit, the [[Torch]] has a chance of gaining 1 damage, which makes it deal more damage the longer the fight goes. Still, this damage doesn't generally reach extreme heights, usually capping at around 6 or 7 damage by the time the fight is over.

The [[Torch]] can be crafted into the [[Burning Torch]] by placing it next to any [[Fire]] item, which is a straight upgrade, giving 2 {{icon/heat}} on start of battle and having a higher chance of gaining damage. The [[Torch]] can also be crafted into the [[Magic Torch]] using a [[Mana Potion]], although this is a bit more difficult to acquire. The [[Magic Torch]] deals higher DPS, and trades the probabilistic +1 damage on hit for guaranteed +1 damage on hit to itself and two of its neighbor [[weapon]]s, at the cost of a {{icon/mana}}.
